            "text": "She says states should remain responsible for conducting elections.",
            "cites": [5]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the Assembly, Irwin helped pass a law allowing prosecutors to consolidate theft charges from different counties into one case. She opposed bills that would have encouraged judges to prioritize diversion programs over incarceration or allowed some young adults to clear low-level offense records.",
